  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Unlimited qi sea grows stronger by gathering many kinds of qi. After Qi Xiang created the move, he collected all sorts of qi into the immortal aperture, including death qi among life qi, sword qi, blade qi, dusk qi, dawn qi, and others. Unused stored qi dissipates over time. Sword qi, blade qi, dusk qi, and dawn qi from that stock are covered on sword qi, blade qi, dusk qi, and dawn qi.",
      "chapters": [
        1934
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "unlimited-qi-sea-stock",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qi_xiang",
        "res_sword_qi",
        "res_blade_qi",
        "res_dusk_qi",
        "res_dawn_qi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan’s modified unlimited qi sea can expend qi path immortal materials to raise its power. It can use all kinds of qi in the world, including death qi; the more qi path immortal materials stored in it, the stronger the move.",
      "chapters": [
        2052
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "immortal-material-fuel",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Fang Yuan annexes Qi Xiang grotto-heaven, the sovereign immortal aperture first gains the largest quantity of heaven and earth qi among its new qi currents, then death qi appears among immortal materials that form alongside profound yin qi, luck qi, blood qi, astral qi, domination qi, life qi, righteous qi, orchid vitality qi, elderly qi, and other named qi materials. Heaven and earth qi, elderly qi, and righteous qi from that production are covered on heaven qi, earth qi, elderly qi, and righteous qi.",
      "chapters": [
        2109
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sovereign-aperture-qi",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_qi_xiang_grotto_heaven",
        "sys_heaven_qi",
        "sys_earth_qi",
        "res_elderly_qi",
        "res_righteous_qi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Qi monsters vary in temperament by the qi that forms them. Qi monsters made from death qi love to be in places filled with many deaths.",
      "chapters": [
        2162
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death-seeking-monsters",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
